ection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-392r5gar6oi0000\">string</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-97049cix7qc0000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-aypimpzlfkw0000\">订阅服务类型，枚举值：<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">report.stdschedule.activeprogram</code></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-4axvlswns660000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-2qoi3k6a5ds0000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-7juh5qrbryg000\">publish_time</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-8z8hj4glyck0000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-c0lhh4e90xk0000\">number</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t14s3w5q8-a6chrxci5wc0000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-389moxxdcf00000\">消息实际产生时间，毫秒时间戳</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-cuxf3ogq3a00000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tejdrzb9c-f3sjg3ygin40000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ciqg8jsczr40000\">timestamp</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1